        "text": "Avatar"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "The **Avatar** component displays a profile image inside a bordered rounded square."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Overview"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "In Figma, this component is defined as a single `COMPONENT` (`Avatar`) with fixed structure:"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "No variant properties"
          },
          {
            "text": "No text overrides"
          },
          {
            "text": "One image layer (`Img_bg`) inside a clipped container"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Source: [Avatar in Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/3hGC1ju0d5AKzaoI9pKIyu/PFB---Design-System?node-id=146-474)"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Anatomy"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Each avatar contains:"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": true,
        "items": [
          {
            "index": 1,
            "text": "**Container** (`COMPONENT`, `90 x 90`)"
          },
          {
            "index": 2,
            "text": "**Img_bg** (`RECTANGLE`, `90 x 90`, image fill)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Component API"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Properties"
      },
      {
        "type": "table",
        "header": [
          "Name",
          "Type",
          "Default",
          "Required",
          "Description"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "`—`",
            "`—`",
            "`—`",
            "`—`",
            "This component has no exposed Figma component properties."
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Visual Specifications"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Container"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "**Size**: `90 x 90`"
          },
          {
            "text": "**Layout**: `NONE` (no Auto Layout)"
          },
          {
            "text": "**Corner radius**: `8px` on all corners"
          },
          {
            "text": "**Border**: `2px`, aligned `INSIDE`"
          },
          {
            "text": "**Border color token**: `Color/Border/Neutral/Default`"
          },
          {
            "text": "**Border color fallback**: `#9A9090`"
          },
          {
            "text": "**Fill**: none"
          },
          {
            "text": "**Clips content**: `true`"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Iconography"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Not applicable. This component renders an image surface, not an icon slot."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Image Layer (`Img_bg`)"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "**Node type**: `RECTANGLE`"
          },
          {
            "text": "**Size**: `90 x 90`"
          },
          {
            "text": "**Fill**: `IMAGE` with scale mode `FILL`"
          },
          {
            "text": "**Strokes**: none"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
