          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Variants"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "This component has no variants in the current Figma definition."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "States"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "This component has no interactive states."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Usage Guidelines"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "**When to use**: Use this component to represent a user or entity with a square profile image."
          },
          {
            "text": "**When not to use**: Do not use it for icon buttons or status indicators."
          },
          {
            "text": "**Do**: Use square image assets to avoid unpredictable cropping."
          },
          {
            "text": "**Do**: Keep avatar size consistent inside the same UI context."
          },
          {
            "text": "**Don't**: Stretch non-square images."
          },
          {
            "text": "**Don't**: Rely on this component for interaction states not defined in Figma."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Content Guidelines"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "This component has no text content."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Accessibility"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "1. ARIA role and semantics"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "If rendered as a decorative image, use `aria-hidden=\"true\"` or empty `alt`."
          },
          {
            "text": "If rendered as informative content, use semantic `img` with descriptive `alt`."
          },
          {
            "text": "For interactive usage, wrap in a semantic interactive element and define role semantics in implementation (`TBD`)."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "2. Keyboard navigation"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "This component is not keyboard-interactive by itself."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "3. Focus management"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "No focus behavior is defined in the Figma component."
          },
          {
            "text": "If used in an interactive wrapper, focus behavior is `TBD`."
          },
          {
            "text": "Focus outline tokens (`Semantic.Color.Focus-Outline.Inner`, `Semantic.Color.Focus-Outline.Outer`) apply only when wrapped in a focusable control."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "4. Labeling"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Informative usage requires descriptive `alt` text."
          },
          {
            "text": "Decorative usage should avoid redundant labeling."
          },
          {
            "text": "`aria-label` and `aria-labelledby` patterns are `TBD` for clickable wrappers."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "5. Contrast and visibility"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Border visibility should remain distinguishable against surrounding surfaces."
          },
          {
            "text": "Contrast verification is `TBD (pending audit)`."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Related Components"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "[Bottom Bar](bottom_bar.md): Use for navigation actions; avatar may appear inside destinations opened from navigation."
          },
          {
            "text": "[Alert](alert.md): Use for feedback messaging; avatar should not be used as feedback status."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Gaps / TBD"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "No size variants (`sm`, `md`, `lg`, etc.) in Figma."
          },
          {
            "text": "No explicit fallback variant for empty/missing image."
          },
          {
            "text": "No explicit interaction states (`hover`, `focus`, `selected`, `disabled`)."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
